Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 00:05:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Trade evolutions without trading

Kadabra, Machoke, Graveler and Haunter evolve at level 37. The twelve
trade-evolution items work like evolution stones on the Pokemon that
used to need a trade while holding them. Generated by
tools/hack/trade_evos.py.
